SUMMARY:AI Tinkerers Lausanne — November 2026 Meetup
LOCATION:Unlimitrust Campus\, Route des Flumeaux 42\, Prilly (Lausanne)
DESCRIPTION:A demo-first evening for people actually building with AI: arou
 nd half a dozen five-minute demos of work in progress\, each followed by q
 uestions — slides and pitch decks are explicitly not allowed — then pi
 zza and networking.\n\nOrganiser: AI Tinkerers Lausanne\, hosted at the Un
 limitrust Campus\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/e
 vents/ai-tinkerers-lausanne-november-2026/
